            <ArticleTitle>Blunt avulsion of the extensor carpi radialis longus by an industrial food mixer.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>695-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This report documents the blunt avulsion of the tendon of origin of the extensor carpi radialis longus. The unusual industrial injury presented with the severe pain and tense swelling of a compartment syndrome.</AbstractText>
